WEBVTT

00:08:27.192 --> 00:08:30.517
"Here, sex is the opposite of sport.

00:08:30.517 --> 00:08:32.683
Football, everybody talks about it,

00:08:32.683 --> 00:08:34.653
but hardly anyone plays.

00:08:34.653 --> 00:08:36.626
But sex, everybody is doing it,

00:08:36.626 --> 00:08:40.775
but nobody wants to talk about it."
(Laughter)

00:08:40.775 --> 00:08:51.348
(Music) (In Arabic)

00:08:51.348 --> 00:08:54.007
SEF: I want to give you a piece of advice,

00:08:54.007 --> 00:08:58.101
which if you follow it,
will make you happy in life.

00:08:58.101 --> 00:09:00.476
When your husband reaches out to you,